:bhishma a yc:Person ;
    rdfs:label "Bhishma" ;
    rdfs:comment "Devavrata, the Vasu Dyaus reborn. Vows lifelong celibacy so Shantanu can marry Satyavati, and can choose the hour of his death. Teaches Yudhishthira from his bed of arrows." ;
