:krishna a yc:Avatar ;
    rdfs:label "Krishna" ;
    rdfs:comment "Eighth avatar of Vishnu and Narayana reborn. Cousin of the Pandavas through Kunti, friend and charioteer of Arjuna. His death opens the Kali Yuga." ;
