:parikshit a yc:Person ;
    rdfs:label "Parikshit" ;
    rdfs:comment "Son of Abhimanyu and Uttara. Ashwatthama's weapon kills him in the womb and Krishna revives him. Rules as Kali begins and dies by Takshaka's bite." ;
